# Summary

Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws[[cite:obs-3add8a67e0499d2b46f6a535c1456ad3b88f8e51 "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]]. Novels may be kept for twenty-one days and the loan is renewable twice[[cite:obs-89a01b2835c91eabc29c7a4c72135e8500f072f5 "Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice."]].
